{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/大自然的庇护","pageid":5152,"revid":11692,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>大自然的庇护</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.A4.A7.E8.87.AA.E7.84.B6.E7.9A.84.E5.BA.87.E6.8A.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"大自然的庇护\"><b>大自然的庇护</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 大自然的庇护.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/16/rp9zlx3i9c6k5imjqlygux9vyhrstlv.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/16/rp9zlx3i9c6k5imjqlygux9vyhrstlv.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%BA%87%E6%8A%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/16/rp9zlx3i9c6k5imjqlygux9vyhrstlv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />大自然的庇护\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">70%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼伤害2</font></span></span>]，并使范围内地形格变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"花田\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">花田</font></span></span>]；若攻击前目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"花田\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">花田</font></span></span>]，则额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。随后使场上的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"植物朋友\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">植物朋友</font></span></span>]发动<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次相同的效果。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ae/hp9k0iltoe2iq8n6u80ny5dwrlv7l6n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%8A%99%E6%8B%89%E7%BB%B4%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/芙拉维娅\"><img alt=\"头像 芙拉维娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/gkn483al8ue62m8a4du2ixq3ousmg1k.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">芙拉维娅</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>